%N A364620 G.f. satisfies A(x) = 1/(1-x)^2 + x*A(x)^3.
%F A364620 a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} binomial(n+3*k+1,4*k+1) * binomial(3*k,k) / (2*k+1).
%F A364620 D-finite with recurrence 2*n*(2*n+1)*a(n) -3*n*(13*n-7)*a(n-1) +3*(-13*n^2+109*n-132)*a(n-2) +(235*n^2-1453*n+2184)*a(n-3) -9*(29*n-97)*(n-4)*a(n-4) +6*(13*n-55)*(2*n-9)*a(n-5) -2*(17*n-78)*(2*n-11)*a(n-6) +6*(n-5)*(2*n-13)*a(n-7)=0. - _R. J. Mathar_, Nov 04 2026
%o A364620 (PARI) a(n) = sum(k=0, n, binomial(n+3*k+1, 4*k+1)*binomial(3*k, k)/(2*k+1));
